From: mochiOS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] mboot: share Hardware Domain backends and add ARM64 HVC transport

Keep the existing control, block, GPU and input implementations in one place.
Leave x86 detection and PCI interrupt admission on x86; reject ARM physical
PCI assignment until its interrupt and IOMMU ownership is implemented.

